(Written statement - Gulshan branch) '
() '
(Witness: Lamia Haque, front desk) '
(Date: the evening of the incident) '
() '
(At about 7:40 pm a member \(Jahid Islam\) shouted at another member who) '
(was waiting for the flat bench. He used abusive language and refused) '
(to leave the bench when the trainer on duty asked him to.) '
() '
(The trainer, Sam Cole, separated the two members. Nobody was hurt.) '
() '
(Signed: Lamia Haque) '
ET
